  "future_release_notes": {
    "zh-CN": "• 修复CFA-50、普通Su-57、DarkStar及XFA-33 A/C切换SP时舱门未正常闭合的问题。\n• 适配S32的IRCM武器，能与其他SP同时携带。\n• 修复任务中降落补给时卡死问题。",
    "en": "• Fixed weapon bays failing to close properly when switching SP weapons on CFA-50, standard Su-57, DarkStar and XFA-33 A/C.\n• Added support for the S32's IRCM weapon, allowing it to be carried together with other SP weapons.\n• Fixed freezing during mid-mission landing and resupply."
  },
